{
  "name": "Brusato Trasporti — quotation pilot",
  "notes": [
    "Spec §9: start at the coarsest useful resolution. IN = request complete, OUT = quote sent email.",
    "TO CONFIRM with Brusato (spec §14): the quotes mailbox, the quote number format, and how a quotation email can be told apart from a clarification reply. The values below are placeholders.",
    "Baseline (CallDash OBSERVE): CallDash does not fill the form, so there is no REQUEST_COMPLETE. The IN is the end of a call that CallDash classified as a new request. That is no earlier than the moment the request was complete, so baseline elapsed is if anything slightly short: it never flatters later modes.",
    "quote-preparation is defined but stays empty until the box needs opening (spec §5, §12 step 6)."
  ],
  "mailboxes": ["preventivi@brusato.example"],
  "emailThreading": true,
  "boxes": [
    {
      "boxType": "quotation",
      "label": "Quotation",
      "in": [
        { "source": "calldash", "eventType": "REQUEST_COMPLETE" },
        { "source": "calldash", "eventType": "CALL_COMPLETED", "attrs": { "status": "done" } },
        { "source": "email", "eventType": "EMAIL_RECEIVED", "attrs": { "mailbox": "preventivi@brusato.example" } },
        { "source": "system", "eventType": "REQUEST_COMPLETE" }
      ],
      "gate": [
        { "source": "calldash", "eventType": "REQUEST_COMPLETE" },
        { "source": "calldash", "eventType": "OBSERVATION_READY", "attrs": { "intent": "new_request" } },
        { "source": "email", "eventType": "EMAIL_RECEIVED", "attrs": { "mailbox": "preventivi@brusato.example" } },
        { "source": "system", "eventType": "REQUEST_COMPLETE" },
        { "source": "manual", "eventType": "REQUEST_COMPLETE" }
      ],
      "out": [
        {
          "source": "email",
          "eventType": "EMAIL_SENT",
          "attrs": { "mailbox": "preventivi@brusato.example" },
          "attachment": "(preventiv|offert|quot).*\\.pdf$"
        },
        { "source": "system", "eventType": "QUOTE_SENT" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "boxType": "quote-preparation",
      "label": "Quote preparation",
      "parent": "quotation",
      "in": [{ "source": "agent", "eventType": "AGENT_START", "attrs": { "boxType": "quote-preparation" } }],
      "out": [{ "source": "agent", "eventType": "AGENT_DONE", "attrs": { "boxType": "quote-preparation" } }]
    }
  ],
  "refExtractors": [
    {
      "system": "brusato-quote",
      "separator": "/",
      "source": "email",
      "field": "subject",
      "pattern": "(?:preventivo|prev\\.|offerta)\\s*(?:n\\.?|nr\\.?|#)?\\s*(?<id>\\d{1,6}\\s*[/-]\\s*\\d{2,4})"
    },
    {
      "system": "brusato-quote",
      "separator": "/",
      "source": "email",
      "field": "attachment",
      "pattern": "(?:preventivo|prev|offerta)[_ -]*(?:n\\.?|nr\\.?)?[_ -]*(?<id>\\d{1,6}[_/-]\\d{2,4})"
    }
  ],
  "modeSchedule": []
}
